                <mxCell id="note7" value="Controllers: HealthRecordController@store; HealthVisitController@store, show, update, destroy&#xa;Models/services: HealthRecord; HealthVisit; Resident&#xa;Tables/integrations: health_records; health_visits; residents&#xa;Migration caveat: no inspected migration creates health_records. Migration 2026_09_30_052025_create_health_records_table.php drops health_visits in up(); it does not recreate either table. The earlier health_visits migration creates the table, but the later migration leaves it absent. On a fresh migration-only database both write paths can fail unless the required schemas are provisioned separately.&#xa;The missing-table path affects reads as well as writes; the success path requires these tables to be provisioned outside the inspected migrations." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
