                <mxCell id="note13" value="Controllers: AnnouncementController@preview, store, resolveTargetResidents, createRecipients, createSmsDeliveries&#xa;Models/services: Announcement; Resident; AnnouncementRecipient; AnnouncementSmsDelivery; User; AnnouncementPublishedNotification&#xa;Tables/integrations: announcements; residents; announcement_recipients; announcement_sms_deliveries; users; notifications&#xa;Publishing never sends SMS. It transactionally creates announcement/recipient/pending-delivery rows, then sends database notifications after commit.&#xa;The POST announcements.preview endpoint exists, but announcements/create.blade.php does not invoke it; publishing is the UI flow shown here." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
