                <mxCell id="note14" value="Controllers: AnnouncementController@sendPendingSms; buildSmsMessage; UniSmsService@send; handleResponse&#xa;Models/services: Announcement; AnnouncementSmsDelivery; UniSmsService&#xa;Tables/integrations: announcement_sms_deliveries; UniSMS HTTPS API&#xa;SMS is disabled by default (UNISMS_SMS_ENABLED=false). Connection failures may have uncertain provider acceptance; verify provider activity before retrying. Accepted is not proof of handset receipt.&#xa;A Sent delivery row means UniSMS accepted the request into its queue, not that a handset received it. No delivery-receipt callback route is implemented." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
