                <mxCell id="note17" value="Controllers: DashboardController@admin; official; healthworker&#xa;Models/services: Resident; Household; HealthVisit; SeniorCitizen; Event; Announcement&#xa;Tables/integrations: residents; households; health_visits; senior_citizens; events; announcements&#xa;Admin queries resident/household/health-visit/senior metrics; Official adds events and announcements; Health Worker uses resident, household, senior counts and recent residents.&#xa;On a fresh migration-only database, the administrator dashboard reaches HealthVisit::count() but health_visits was dropped by a later migration, so that dashboard request fails before rendering." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
