                <mxCell id="access-note" value="Role checks follow each route group: System Administrator only for users, settings, audit logs, and backups; System Administrator and Health Worker for medical inventory; all three staff roles for residents, households, health modules, certificates, announcements, and dashboards. Schedule, notifications, reports, and analytics require authentication only. No resident login or portal route is implemented." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#713f12;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#d97706;" vertex="1" parent="1">
